{
  "comment": "Design tokens (docs/design/04 §0, 08 §6, 09 §5.3). Tools/ui-tokens.mjs turns this file into Unity/Assets/Game/Presentation/UI/Resources/UI/Styles/Tokens.uss: each group listed in 'groups' becomes CSS variables --<prefix>-<kebab-key>, numbers get the group's unit, strings pass through (percentages, rgba). Kit and screen USS may only use these variables (the check fails on raw colours or lengths). Colours are the shipped palette (ui/theme.json) plus the role colours 04 §0 names (ready green, destructive red, neutral brown and gold). Durations are also read by code through TokenKeys (hold-to-confirm, refusal, tooltip delay, gate settle).",
  "webSource": {
    "pinned": "cehinds/ashenspire b8cfe4fac, art release hd-assets-v23",
    "palette": "styles/base.css:188-193 hi-contrast parchment/muted/line/line-soft (default on: src/ui/screens/settings.js:676); base values base.css:4-9,22-26; resHp/rot/frost/grace/ember/green base.css:35-40",
    "positiveControl": "styles/kit.css:4699 (fill #255c39, border #6fb580, text #f0fff3)",
    "baseButton": "styles/base.css:336-347 (panel fill, 2px gold border, gold text, r-3, Cinzel, +0.1em), hover base.css:348",
    "radius": "styles/base.css:148-153 (3/6/8/12/pill/round); modal base kit.css:445",
    "typeScale": "html 62.5% base.css:235-241; body 1.4rem base.css:299-306; --t-1..4 = 10/12/15/18 base.css:179-182; button --t-3 base.css:344; eyebrow 1rem +0.18em kit.css:34; titles 2.55/2.25/1.8rem kit.css:35-37; label 0.93rem +0.12em kit.css:385,403; chip 0.93rem +0.1em kit.css:250",
    "fonts": "--font-display Cinzel, --font-body Inter base.css:183-184; lore faces kit.css:4376-4399 (default Fell)",
    "shadow": "text 0 1px 2px #000 styles/hud-layout.generated.css:27 and kit.css:890; modal 0 24px 72px rgba(0,0,0,.69) + inset gold top line kit.css:451; wordmark glow 0 0 60px rgba(201,162,39,.6) styles/ui.css:482",
    "focus": "outline 2px solid gold, offset 2px styles/kit.css:2533",
    "wordmarkSize": "~68 device px at 1080p, zoom 1.48 (docs/qa/visual-gap-2026-10-24.md section 2); Unity compact and narrow keep the old ratios",
    "unityScale": "web design 1200x730 at zoom 0.99 on 1280x720 (main.js applyUiScale), so web CSS px equal Unity reference px",
    "chrome": "panel frame: styles/player-polish.css:30 (border-image panel-frame.svg slice 24 drawn 12 px wide; radius 3), modal fill, shadow and top line styles/kit.css:445-452; button face gradient player-polish.css:48-50; plate sprites player-polish.css:220-223 (button-neutral and button-primary-ready/-focus/-pressed.svg, slice 12 drawn 6 px); divider player-polish.css:41-43 (12 px high); tooltip kit.css:684-696 (panel fill, 1 px gold, r-2, shadow 0 8px 22px .55); sprites by Tools/ui-frames.mjs",
    "buttons": "neutral kit.css:90-101 (panel fill, 1 px line-soft, r-3, parchment text, hover/focus gold border); primary = gold 20% mixed over panel kit.css:107-109 (30% hover); danger #d4622e kit.css:110-118,2526 (14% / 24% over panel); ready fill kit.css:4699-4707; disabled kit.css:102; exit role goes red when highlighted kit.css:4712; hold hint kit.css:2893 (0.75em, +0.14em, gold, .75)",
    "chips": "StatePill kit.css:254-262 (1 px line-soft, r-1, 1.02rem +0.06em uppercase muted, on = gold), Tag kit.css:265; scrollbar kit.css:673-679 (8 px, thumb line-soft radius 4, transparent track)",
    "board": "VP-4 combat board (D-700): wide values are the web's 1920x1080 pixels (docs/qa/web-screens/combat-*-1920x1080.jpg, pinned b8cfe4fac) divided by 1.5 (web zoom puts the 1280x720 reference canvas at 1.5x); narrow values are the 390x844 shots divided by 0.907 (430-wide reference canvas). Footer art boxes: content/config/ui/presentation/footerLayout.json (orb frame 192, inner orb 128, diamonds 44x64 on r 88 every 30 degrees, plate 280x87, draw 112x145, discard 116x140, potions 192x127, scaled 0.32); desktop footer sizing content/config/ui/scenes/w4a-combat.json desktopFooter (end art 240x74.6, hand 204x306 cards on a 200 px step); layer order hud/footer styles via src/ui/components/footerArt.js; ground grid Tools/ui-stage.mjs",
    "card": "face group = CARD_COMPONENTS.template (src/content/cardComponents.generated.js, 360x540 design px): layer boxes and image trims, cost layouts, rank anchor (src/ui/components/cardLayout.js); the action band lifts the parchment, rules and art by 6.1% of the height (src/ui/components/illustratedCard.js); marks in cqw: styles/illustrated-cards.css:20-27 title fade, :28 footer backdrop, :37 name stroke/shadow, :53-67 band, :68-73 rail, :74-86 rank; glow :39 (gold, #c49b56) and the armed blue read off docs/qa/web-screens/combat-card-selected-1920x1080.jpg; written by Tools/card-face.mjs. Card sizes: the template is 2:3 (src/ui/models/CardSizeModel.js); hand 178 css px x zoom ~0.79 = 140 reference px (combat.css:1141, the 1920 captures show 210 px); glance 152 px (kit.css:1214), inspect 320 px (kit.css:3911)",
    "modals": "VP-6 combat overlays (D-800): modal shell kit.css:440-497 (head inset 1.4rem, eyebrow 1rem +0.18em muted caps, title 1.8rem Cinzel gold +0.045em, status 1.2rem muted, hairline under the head and over the foot, widths md 57rem / xl 96rem x 88%, 8 px scroll thumb), close glyph kit.css:122-149 (75% face), card option tiles combat.css:2037-2057 (name 700, effect .92em, costs .75em pills, min 11rem), reaction modal src/ui/components/reactionChoiceModal.js, piles src/ui/components/piles.js, potions list src/ui/components/combatActionRow.js:151-198, quick menu src/ui/components/quicknav.js, inspect src/ui/components/cardInspection.js. Measured on docs/qa/web-screens/combat-{reaction-offer,defeat-reaction-offer,potions,draw-pile,quick-menu,intent-tooltip,target-hover}-1920x1080.jpg divided by 1.5: reaction/potions modal 840 px = 560, piles 1416 x 925 = 944 x 617 (88%), reaction tile 200 x 130 = 133 x 87, potion row 120 = 80 with a 52 px flask (35) and a 150 x 44 Use HOLD button (100 x 30), piles card 216 x 340 = 144 x 216, quick menu 465 px = 310 (rows 49 = 33, top 85 = 56, right 17 = 11), target card 223 = 149. Veil: the shot background is ~35% bright, so rgba(13,11,8,0.66)."
